Error [jet.InvalidOverflowOptIn]: `saturating` has nothing to keep from a `Decimal` that isn't whole
  --> tests/ui/typed_lit_exact_saturating.jet:3:23
    |
  3 |     _: saturating(Int{price})
    |                       ^^^^^
 Why: An exact number converts to an Int whole or not at all; the overflow word that applies to it is `checked` (None when it isn't whole)
 Fix: Write `checked(Int{value})`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E1005
